{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=member_0","headline":"湖畔 · 石湖客","name":"湖畔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湖水把天空折叠成一块蓝手帕\n我坐在岸上，把影子交给风\n远处有白鹭独自练习起飞\n而我的句子，还停在水面发呆","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"石湖客","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/member_0.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=member_0","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"现代诗","abstract":"收录于选自《石湖诗社社课习作》（2025）","citation":"石湖客自注"}